OL,3,GNEWSAAndrew Tate exaggerates and did
OL,4,Anot own supercars in photos, his
OL,5,Alawyers say
OL,6,
OL,7,FControversial influencer Andrew Tate
OL,8,Fportrays himself as "uberwealthy" but
OL,9,Fdid not own cars and a yacht featured
OL,10,Fon his social media and exaggerated his
OL,11,Flifestyle for online attention, his
OL,12,Flegal representatives have said.
OL,14,FTate and his brother Tristan are
OL,15,Fcurrently being held in a Florida jail
OL,16,Fbut are seeking release on bail while
OL,17,Fthey await the outcome of extradition
OL,18,Fproceedings.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
