OL,3,GNEWSAAndrew Tate exaggerates and did
OL,4,Anot own supercars in photos, his
OL,5,Alawyers say
OL,6,
OL,7,FThey were arrested last month after
OL,8,FBritish prosecutors unveiled new
OL,9,Fcharges including alleged sexual
OL,10,Foffences against them, which both men
OL,11,Fdeny.
OL,13,FProsecutors have argued the Tates are a
OL,14,F"flight risk", citing the brothers'
OL,15,Fpast statements about their wealth and
OL,16,Finfluence and having multiple
OL,17,Fidentities to evade the law.
